=== Provenance / attribution ===

The following files are derived from pytorch-minimize
(https://github.com/rfeinman/pytorch-minimize, MIT, (c) 2021 Reuben Feinman),
with modifications (the Newton, trust-region, constrained and least-squares
solvers were removed; ScalarFunction was reduced to first order and extended
with GradientObjective):

    evaluation/methods/minimize.py
    evaluation/methods/cg.py
    evaluation/methods/wolfe_line_search.py

The following files are original to this repository (not part of
pytorch-minimize):

    evaluation/methods/nmapg.py        (nmAPG; algorithm: Li & Lin, NeurIPS 2015)
    evaluation/methods/lbfgs_batched.py
    evaluation/methods/function.py
    evaluation/reconstruct.py
    evaluation/evaluate.py

All of the above are distributed under the MIT License reproduced above.
